      {
        "id": 41865,
        "name": "Paul",
        "username": "Paul",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-10-31T16:11:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We definitely considered making shipping cost dependent on weight. However, 90% of packages we send out are close enough in weight that the shipping charges don't vary much, and such a system, given the wide variety of options selected by the other 10% of people, would be incredibly difficult to manage.</p>",
